    <CultureDef>
        <defName>ESCP_Culture_Breton</defName>
        <label>Breton</label>
        <description>The culture of High Rock's city-states: sophisticated, mercantile, and the most naturally arcane of the races of men. Breton society prizes learning, commerce, and the kind of political intelligence that lets you win an argument before the other party realizes there was one. Their cathedrals are the finest in Tamriel, their courts the most diplomatically active, and their mages the most numerous. The synthesis of Nedic and Aldmeri blood that produced the Breton people also produced their characteristic talent for the arcane arts, and they have never stopped developing it.</description>
        <iconPath>UI/Cultures/ESCP_Culture_Imperial</iconPath>
        <pawnNameMaker>ESCP_Breton_Namer_Male</pawnNameMaker>
        <pawnNameMakerFemale>ESCP_Breton_Namer_Female</pawnNameMakerFemale>
        <allowedPlaceTags>
            <li>OriginSpacer</li>
        </allowedPlaceTags>
        <styleItemTags>
            <li>
                <tag>NoBeard</tag>
                <baseWeight>4</baseWeight>
                <weightFactor>1</weightFactor>
            </li>
            <li>
                <tag>BeardRural</tag>
                <baseWeight>1</baseWeight>
                <weightFactor>1</weightFactor>
            </li>
            <li>
                <tag>Urban</tag>
