    <CultureDef>
        <defName>ESCP_Culture_Redguard</defName>
        <label>Redguard</label>
        <description>The culture of Hammerfell's desert kingdoms: proud, martial, and shaped by the Alik'r's merciless heat as much as by ancient Yokudan memory. Redguard society prizes individual honor, blade-craft above all other arts, and the word of one's oath above the law of any empire. Their sword-singers, the Ansei, are the finest warriors in Tamriel. Their traders know every port from Sentinel to Wayrest. Their dead are given to Tu'whacca, god of souls, and carried safely into the Far Shores, and their living fight hard enough that the afterlife has to wait.</description>
        <iconPath>UI/Cultures/ESCP_Culture_Imperial</iconPath>
        <pawnNameMaker>ESCP_Redguard_Namer_Male</pawnNameMaker>
        <pawnNameMakerFemale>ESCP_Redguard_Namer_Female</pawnNameMakerFemale>
